{"id":"vod_bf_27177","vodId":"27177","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"情色漫画老师","name_cn":"情色漫画老师","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/2c2dae5c06bdf8b2144b4006a1d36faa.jpg"},"summary":"和泉正宗（松冈祯丞 配音）是一名专注于创作轻小说的作家，曾经获得过新人奖，并就此踏上了写作的道路。不久之前，正宗开始了和没有血缘关系的妹妹和泉纱雾（藤田茜 配音）一起的同居生活，哪知道虽然住在同一屋檐下，但正宗几乎没有在家里看到过纱雾，因为纱雾是一个只待在自己房间里绝对不会出来的超级宅女。　　负责给正宗的小说画插图的是一位名叫“情色漫画老师”的插画家，其画技之精湛令正宗深深折服，然而，情色漫画老师未曾有过以其真身示人之时，对于他隐藏在网络背后的真实面目，正宗有着诸多的猜测。然而，让正宗没有想到的是，这位插画家的真身，竟然就是妹妹纱雾！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 11:02:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA01","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/OVA01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OVA02","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/OVA02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/qingsemanhualaoshi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf